Galaxy Map Normandy

Mass Effect, Mass Effect Legendary Edition and all of their content belong to Electronic Arts and BioWare. This mod is
not affiliated with or endorsed by Electronic Arts or BioWare.

This repository contains no game files. Its own files (the UnrealScript sources, the mod's .ini and .m3cd files, the
build script and the documentation) are under the GNU General Public License v3.0, in LICENSE.

build.sh reads game files from the player's own installed copy of Mass Effect Legendary Edition: the SR-1 Normandy
model from LE1's BIOA_ICE20_11_LAY.pcc, two interface sound cues from LE1's snd_gui.pcc (used as templates), and the
Mass Effect 3 galaxy map travel sound from LE3's SFXGame.pcc. docs/ASSETS.md lists what it takes and what it does
with each file.

The built packages contain content derived from those files: GalaxyMapNormandy_SFX.pcc holds the model and the
sounds. That content is not covered by the GPL. The built packages are for personal use with a legitimate copy of the
game.
